+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+array and returns the resulting JSON value. It supports `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy` and
+`test`. The input document is left unchanged; an invalid patch or failed operation throws an error.
